; Instruction Encoding Verifier for fasm g, the fail form (fasm2's companion
; to iev.alm). A line's comment names the error it must stop with:
;
;	{rex2} xsave [rax]		; '{rex2} cannot encode this instruction'
;
; fasmg cannot catch an error from inside the source, so this module only
; assembles each line without its comment; tests\IEV\_run.ps1 matches
; fasmg's error reports to the lines. A line without a comment is setup
; and must assemble without error.

; (comment? also matches a line holding only ';'. No comments below this
; point: retaincomments would make them part of the code.)

	retaincomments

	calminstruction ? line&
		local comment

		match ;comment?, line
		jyes done

		match line;comment, line
		assemble line

	done:
	end calminstruction
